{"id": "LA:order:182484", "jur": "LA", "source": "la_lpsc", "kind": "order", "docket": "U-37927", "title": "Utility Order for Washington - St. Tammany Electric Cooperative, Inc., ex parte. — Order No. U-37927 accepts the Joint Report for the 2025 Test Year Formula Rate Plan filing submitted on August 24, 2026, which found that no rate change was necessary and was in accordance with the terms of Washington-St. Tammany Electric Cooperative (“WST”) Formula Rate Plan. The Order also allowed WST to create a regulatory liability to flow back to ratepayers, subject to the conditions within. This matter was considered at the September 16, 2026 Business and Executive Session.", "filed": "2026-10-12", "url": "https://lpscpubvalence.lpsc.louisiana.gov/portal/PSC/DocumentDetails?documentId=182484", "entity": null, "filing": "data/filings/LA/la_lpsc/LA_order_182484.json", "keywords": [], "party_hits": [], "run_id": "2026-10-13-0457", "docs": [{"url": "https://lpscpubvalence.lpsc.louisiana.gov/portal/PSC/ViewFile?fileId=UKRoZ%2fUUw1k%3d", "quality": "text_layer", "ocr": false, "chars": 6357, "error": null}], "meta": {}}
